{"seq":2,"slug":"core-contributions","title":"稻盛和夫·核心贡献","stage":"DONE","category":"kazuo-inamori","categoryLabel":"稻盛和夫","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/kazuo-inamori/core-contributions","rating":{"composite":3.69,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/10_kazuo-inamori/2_core-contributions","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"核心贡献\">核心贡献</h1><p>本卷回答一个问题：稻盛和夫到底&quot;做出了什么&quot;，使他被称为&quot;经营之圣&quot;？答案集中在三件互相咬合的事上——他<strong>缔造的三大事业</strong>（京瓷、第二电电/KDDI、日本航空重建）、他<strong>独创的阿米巴经营</strong>，以及他<strong>把哲学确立为经营根基</strong>这一更深层的方法论。三者构成一个由表及里的结构：事业是成果，阿米巴是制度，哲学是制度背后的&quot;为什么&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本卷-vs-兄弟卷-分工边界\">本卷 vs 兄弟卷：分工边界</h2><p>为避免与同一人物的其他卷重复，本卷严格聚焦&quot;贡献本身的事实与机制&quot;，把人物经历、思想全貌、著作、影响与争议交给对应兄弟卷：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>想了解</th>\n<th>去哪一卷</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>他做出了什么贡献（本卷）</td>\n<td>核心贡献</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>他的生平、如何走到这一步</td>\n<td><a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>思想的完整体系（人生方程式、敬天爱人、六项精进）</td>\n<td><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>他写了哪些书</td>\n<td><a href=\"../major-works/\">主要著作</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>他对后世的影响与遗产</td>\n<td><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对他的批评、争议与平衡评价</td>\n<td><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>具体而言：本卷讲阿米巴&quot;怎么运作&quot;，思想卷讲&quot;敬天爱人&quot;的哲学源流；本卷讲日航&quot;如何被扭亏&quot;，生平卷讲稻盛&quot;为何接手日航&quot;。同一事实只在最合适的卷展开，其余卷以相对路径交叉链接。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三章结构与阅读路径\">三章结构与阅读路径</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[第3章 哲学为根基&lt;br/&gt;为什么] --&gt; B[第2章 阿米巴经营&lt;br/&gt;用什么制度]&#10;    B --&gt; C[第1章 三大事业&lt;br/&gt;做出了什么]&#10;    C -.成果反过来验证哲学.-&gt; A\">flowchart TD\n    A[第3章 哲学为根基&lt;br/&gt;为什么] --&gt; B[第2章 阿米巴经营&lt;br/&gt;用什么制度]\n    B --&gt; C[第1章 三大事业&lt;br/&gt;做出了什么]\n    C -.成果反过来验证哲学.-&gt; A</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>第 1 章 · 三大事业</strong>：<a href=\"three-great-enterprises/kyocera-the-foundation\">京瓷：事业的基石</a>（创业事实、技术路线、制度起源）→ <a href=\"three-great-enterprises/kddi-and-jal-turnaround\">第二电电与日航重建</a>（方法跨行业的两次实证）。</li>\n<li><strong>第 2 章 · 阿米巴经营</strong>：<a href=\"amoeba-management/the-amoeba-system\">阿米巴经营模式</a>（划分、核算、内部交易的机制）→ <a href=\"amoeba-management/management-by-all\">全员经营的理念</a>（制度背后&quot;人人都是经营者&quot;的理念）。</li>\n<li><strong>第 3 章 · 经营哲学</strong>：<a href=\"management-philosophy/philosophy-as-foundation\">哲学作为经营的根基</a>（核心命题与判准）→ <a href=\"management-philosophy/seiwajuku-and-passing-on\">盛和塾与哲学的传承</a>（传承机制与其难点）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>推荐路径</strong>：若你关心&quot;怎么落地经营&quot;，按 1→2→3 顺读（成果→制度→理念）；若你关心&quot;为什么有效&quot;，按 3→2→1 逆读（理念→制度→成果）。两条路径殊途同归。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前置与延伸\">前置与延伸</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>前置</strong>：无硬性前置。若对人物完全陌生，建议先浏览 <a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a> 建立背景。</li>\n<li><strong>关键事实锚点</strong>：京瓷 1959 年创立（资本金 300 万日元、28 人）；第二电电 1984 年成立、2000 年并为 KDDI；日航 2010 年破产、稻盛零薪重建、2011 财年约 2049 亿日元营业利润、2012 年重新上市；盛和塾 1983 年起、2019 年底解散（约 1.5 万塾生）。</li>\n<li><strong>批判性阅读</strong>：本卷在每篇都给出&quot;反模式&quot;与边界，读完建议对照 <a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a> 形成平衡判断，避免把案例当成&quot;哲学万能&quot;的证据。</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"three-great-enterprises","title":"三大事业","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/kazuo-inamori/core-contributions/three-great-enterprises","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"kyocera-the-foundation","title":"京瓷：事业的基石","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/kazuo-inamori/core-contributions/three-great-enterprises/kyocera-the-foundation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"kddi-and-jal-turnaround","title":"第二电电与日航重建","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/kazuo-inamori/core-contributions/three-great-enterprises/kddi-and-jal-turnaround"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"amoeba-management","title":"阿米巴经营","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/kazuo-inamori/core-contributions/amoeba-management","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-amoeba-system","title":"阿米巴经营模式","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/kazuo-inamori/core-contributions/amoeba-management/the-amoeba-system"},{"seq":2,"slug":"management-by-all","title":"全员经营的理念","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/kazuo-inamori/core-contributions/amoeba-management/management-by-all"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"management-philosophy","title":"经营哲学体系","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/kazuo-inamori/core-contributions/management-philosophy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"philosophy-as-foundation","title":"哲学作为经营的根基","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/kazuo-inamori/core-contributions/management-philosophy/philosophy-as-foundation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"seiwajuku-and-passing-on","title":"盛和塾与哲学的传承","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/kazuo-inamori/core-contributions/management-philosophy/seiwajuku-and-passing-on"}]}]}